Artwork and name

The ⌈seal⌉ artwork (the seals drawn by the generator, their traits and the one-of-ones) and the ⌈seal⌉ name and
logo are © ⌈seal⌉, all rights reserved. The MIT license above covers the code, not the right to issue, mint or sell
